{
  "vendor": "sentry",
  "author": "Contributor 93",
  "about": "Harbourline runs Rallly and Twenty, uses Scheduler for social channels and Cal.com for booking. Account setup uses the API after bootstrap; releases, source maps and ingestion follow the pinned application clients. Public fixture projection: static sample identifiers are transformed to deterministic low-entropy synthetic values, with matching references preserved; this is not a verbatim copy of the original private fixture.",
